      <item>Reviews 2026-11-07: UAC-r2 :916-927; ebilling-r1 :929-949; the UAC-r2 follow-up :950-953; ebilling EB-D-207 (work/ebilling-r1 projects/ebilling-r1/notes/decisions-log.md :215).</item>
      <item>Dev profile read on 2026-11-07 (read-only GET): one profile, "Matter to Invoice (Attorney Matrix)", with four access-conferring Contact lookup targets, all refused (design section 6.3).</item>
    </background>
